{"id":"qarabag-silsilesi","qid":"Q2657171","category":"range","type":"oronym","names":{"az":"Qarabağ silsiləsi","ru":"Карабахский хребет","en":"Karabakh Range"},"coordinates":[46.74361,39.58361],"coordinatesSource":"wd","region":null,"regionSource":null,"admin":[],"firstRecord":null,"period":null,"forms":[],"namedAfter":[],"etymology":[],"summary":{"az":{"text":"Qarabağ silsiləsi — Azərbaycanın cənub qərbində dağ silsiləsi.","truncated":false,"source":"wp-az"},"ru":{"text":"Караба́хский хребе́т (азерб. Qarabağ silsiləsi), также Арцахский хребет (арм. Արցախի լեռնաշղթա) — горный хребет Малого Кавказа, расположенный в Азербайджане, протянувшийся от реки Тертер до долины реки Аракс.\nГорный хребет располагается дугой с севера на юго-восток, является водоразделом бассейнов правых притоков Куры — Тертер северо-западе, Хачынчай и Каркарчай на востоке и левых притоков Аракса — Акеры на западе и Кенделанчая на юго-востоке. Река Акера отделяет хребет от Карабахского нагорья.","truncated":true,"source":"wp-ru"},"en":{"text":"The Karabakh Range or Artsakh range is a mountain range of Lesser Caucasus. It stretches in an arc from North to South-East from Tartar river to Aras River. The Hakari River (left tributary of the Aras) separates it from the Karabakh Plateau. The highest point is Mount Kirs (Azerbaijani: Böyük Kirs Dağı, Armenian: Մեծ Քիրս լեռ, lit. 'Great Kirs') (2,725 m).","truncated":false,"source":"wp-en"}},"images":[{"thumb":"https://thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/6/62/Ka%C5%88on_%C5%99eky_Karkar%2C_N%C3%A1horn%C3%AD_Karabach.jpg/960px-Ka%C5%88on_%C5%99eky_Karkar%2C_N%C3%A1horn%C3%AD_Karabach.jpg?utm_source=commons.wikimedia.org&utm_campaign=imageinfo&utm_content=thumbnail","small":"https://thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/6/62/Ka%C5%88on_%C5%99eky_Karkar%2C_N%C3%A1horn%C3%AD_Karabach.jpg/960px-Ka%C5%88on_%C5%99eky_Karkar%2C_N%C3%A1horn%C3%AD_Karabach.jpg?utm_source=commons.wikimedia.org&utm_campaign=imageinfo&utm_content=thumbnail","width":800,"height":600,"page":"https://commons.wikimedia.org/wiki/File:Ka%C5%88on_%C5%99eky_Karkar,_N%C3%A1horn%C3%AD_Karabach.jpg","title":"Kaňon řeky Karkar, Náhorní Karabach.jpg","artist":"Ondřej Žváček","credit":"Own work.","license":"CC BY 2.5","licenseUrl":"https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by/2.5","source":"img-1"}],"sources":[{"id":"wd","kind":"wikidata","title":"Wikidata Q2657171: Karabakh Range","publisher":"Wikidata","url":"https://www.wikidata.org/wiki/Q2657171","licence":"CC0 1.0","retrieved":"2026-11-26"},{"id":"wp-az","kind":"wikipedia","lang":"az","title":"Qarabağ silsiləsi","publisher":"Vikipediya (azərbaycanca)","url":"https://az.wikipedia.org/w/index.php?title=Qaraba%C4%9F_silsil%C9%99si&oldid=9006352","pageUrl":"https://az.wikipedia.org/wiki/Qaraba%C4%9F_silsil%C9%99si","revid":9006352,"revDate":"2026-07-21","licence":"CC BY-SA 4.0","retrieved":"2026-11-26"},{"id":"wp-ru","kind":"wikipedia","lang":"ru","title":"Карабахский хребет","publisher":"Википедия (на русском)","url":"https://ru.wikipedia.org/w/index.php?title=%D0%9A%D0%B0%D1%80%D0%B0%D0%B1%D0%B0%D1%85%D1%81%D0%BA%D0%B8%D0%B9_%D1%85%D1%80%D0%B5%D0%B1%D0%B5%D1%82&oldid=147806494","pageUrl":"https://ru.wikipedia.org/wiki/%D0%9A%D0%B0%D1%80%D0%B0%D0%B1%D0%B0%D1%85%D1%81%D0%BA%D0%B8%D0%B9_%D1%85%D1%80%D0%B5%D0%B1%D0%B5%D1%82","revid":147806494,"revDate":"2025-08-13","licence":"CC BY-SA 4.0","retrieved":"2026-11-26"},{"id":"wp-en","kind":"wikipedia","lang":"en","title":"Karabakh Range","publisher":"Wikipedia (English)","url":"https://en.wikipedia.org/w/index.php?title=Karabakh_Range&oldid=1369305383","pageUrl":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Karabakh_Range","revid":1369305383,"revDate":"2026-08-14","licence":"CC BY-SA 4.0","retrieved":"2026-11-26"},{"id":"img-1","kind":"commons","title":"File:Kaňon řeky Karkar, Náhorní Karabach.jpg","publisher":"Wikimedia Commons","url":"https://commons.wikimedia.org/wiki/File:Ka%C5%88on_%C5%99eky_Karkar,_N%C3%A1horn%C3%AD_Karabach.jpg","licence":"CC BY 2.5","retrieved